<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Champion upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Champion upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Champion Enterprises Inc to the firm's recommended list from market outperformer.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/8 to 19-1/2.</p>
</text>
